cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research, please cite it as below."
title: "DarkMoon Attack Paths Research: agent-declared attack-path edges, server-side qualification and their measured limits"
abstract: >-
  Research documentation on how DarkMoon, an autonomous AI penetration-testing system,
  links findings into attack paths. LLM agents declare which earlier findings enabled a
  new one; the server shows each declaration as a hypothesis and promotes it only by
  exact value attribution on its own execution records. The repository documents the
  architecture, its history, 61 experiments including negative results, decision records,
  a verified literature review and acknowledged limits.
type: software
authors:
